url: 'https://github.com/openehr-rust/openehr-rust/'
abstract: >-
  An implementation of the openEHR Reference Model in Rust — types, validation,
  openEHR paths, AQL parsing, and change-control security — together with an
  engine-agnostic persistence layer, SQL dialects for six database engines, and
  a shared conformance suite. Conformance is stated by evidence level rather
  than by feature list: SQLite is Verified against a real engine in continuous
  integration; the other dialects state exactly how far they have been checked.
